title CampusClaw Plan Mode - Complete Target Interaction
actor User
participant "Client" as UI
participant "Session / Events API" as API
participant "Runtime\nServices + original Agent" as Runtime
participant "Model tools" as Tools
database "Sessions / Events\nExecution controls" as DB

group 1. Create a Session
  User -> UI : Start a Session for an Agent
  UI -> API : POST /agents/{agentId}/sessions; no body
  API -> Runtime : Resolve published Agent settings snapshot
  Runtime --> API : Validated initial mode and plan capability
  API -> DB : Insert idle Session with copied mode
  API --> UI : Created Session; no model execution
end

opt Select plan when the new Session starts in build
  User -> UI : Select plan
  UI -> API : POST Session {mode: plan} + If-Match
  API -> DB : Check idle and ETag; commit mode + history
  API --> UI : Full Session + matching ETag
end

group 2. Research and clarify
  User -> UI : Describe the work
  UI -> API : POST Events: user.message
  API -> Runtime : Prepare base prompt and stable tool profile
  API -> DB : Accept root execution with current mode snapshot
  API -> Runtime : Apply plan common + root review before start
  API --> UI : First SSE frame: committed user.message
  API -> Runtime : Start the accepted execution
  loop Inspect facts and develop proposal
    Runtime -> Tools : Queries / read-only analysis
    Tools --> Runtime : Normal tool results
    Runtime -> DB : Commit ordinary messages and tool events
    Runtime --> UI : Thinking / messages / generic tool events
  end
  opt User-owned choice requires clarification
    Runtime -> DB : Commit question and actual terminal; state=idle, mode=plan
    Runtime --> UI : Question + terminal idle; close response
    User -> UI : Answer the question
    UI -> API : POST next user.message
    API -> Runtime : Prepare, accept and start a new root in the same plan Session
  end
end

group 3. Review the complete proposal
  loop Review attempts; exit on approval
    Runtime -> Tools : ExitPlanMode only; complete Markdown
    Tools -> Runtime : PlanReviewPort.review
    Runtime -> DB : Commit agent.plan + confirming idle + pending review
    Runtime --> UI : Plan card + confirming idle; close response
    note over Runtime,DB
  Session state remains running; mode remains
  plan.
  The review tool waits. No business execution or
  TODO calls.
    end note
    User -> UI : Approve or request revision
    UI -> API : POST user.plan_confirmation(targetEventId, result)
    API -> DB : Lock exact review; accept decision and continuation
    API --> UI : First new SSE frame: committed confirmation
    DB --> Runtime : Original instance claims the decision once
    alt Revise
      Runtime --> Tools : Resume review with approved=false and feedback
      Tools --> Runtime : Normal review result
      Runtime --> UI : Tool result; continued research and new proposal
    else Approve
      note over API,DB
  Approval transaction also commits mode=build and
  mode event.
      end note
      Runtime -> Runtime : Replace plan sections with build + execution TODO guidance
      Runtime --> Tools : Resume review with approved=true
      Tools --> Runtime : Normal review result
      Runtime --> UI : Committed mode change and review result
    end
  end
end

group 4. Implement after approval
  Runtime -> DB : Commit TodoUpdate tool call
  Runtime --> UI : agent.tool_call (toolName=TodoUpdate)
  Runtime -> Tools : TodoUpdate: full implementation list, first item in_progress
  Tools --> Runtime : Validated full JSON snapshot
  Runtime -> DB : At batch end, commit generic tool result
  Runtime --> UI : agent.tool_result (isError=false)
  UI -> UI : Match toolName + call identity; display successful snapshot
  loop Each implementation task
    Runtime -> Tools : Business work and required verification
    Tools --> Runtime : Actual results
    Runtime --> UI : Normal thinking / tool events / messages
    Runtime -> DB : Commit next TodoUpdate tool call
    Runtime --> UI : agent.tool_call (toolName=TodoUpdate)
    Runtime -> Tools : TodoUpdate after verified completion
    note right of Tools
  Full list: completed previous item,
  next item in_progress when starting it.
  Failure does not claim completion.
    end note
    Tools --> Runtime : Validated full JSON snapshot
    Runtime -> DB : Commit generic result at batch end
    Runtime --> UI : Successful agent.tool_result
    UI -> UI : Replace implementation progress
  end
  Runtime -> DB : Commit final answer and actual terminal; state=idle
  Runtime --> UI : Final answer + terminal idle; close response
end

note over UI,DB
  Disconnect: GET Events + GET Session for
  reconciliation; never replay accepted POST.
  Interrupt: existing user.interrupt targets the
  current root and stops the execution.
  The same Session spans clarification roots;
  approval resumes its original root.
  Business-tool permission confirmation remains
  independent.
end note
@enduml
